#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/pendo` — an Instructure-styled global stylesheet for Pendo guides."
msgstr "`@pantoken/pendo` — egy Instructure-stílusú globális stíluskészlet Pendo útmutatókhoz."

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pendo injects guide HTML into a host page; this renders that guide DOM (`._pendo-*`) to match\nInstructure UI, using pantoken's `--instui-*` token layer for alignment. It includes responsive\nviolet and sea banner guide treatments alongside alerts, popovers, surveys, and controls. The\ncomponent CSS is ported from `@instructure/pendo-global-css`; pantoken supplies the tokens and the\nassembly. A single theme class containing `instui` activates the scoped stylesheet; compact\nsuffixes on that class select banner colors and glyphs."
msgstr "Pendo injects guide HTML into a host page; this renders that guide DOM (`._pendo-*`) to match\nInstructure UI, using pantoken's `--instui-*` token layer for alignment. It includes responsive\nviolet and sea banner guide treatments alongside alerts, popovers, surveys, and controls. The\ncomponent CSS is ported from `@instructure/pendo-global-css`; pantoken supplies the tokens and the\nassembly. A single theme class containing `instui` activates the scoped stylesheet; compact\nsuffixes on that class select banner colors and glyphs."

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[buildPendoCss](functions/buildPendoCss.md) composes the stylesheet; [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md) is the ready-made `rebrand` build\n(scoped, `!important`). A static file is published at `@pantoken/pendo/global.css`."
msgstr "A [buildPendoCss](functions/buildPendoCss.md) összeállítja a stíluslapot; a [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md) a készen elkészített `rebrand` összeállítás\n(hatóköri, `!important`). Statikus fájl van közzétéve a `@pantoken/pendo/global.css` címen."

