msgstr "Egy [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) formájú feloldó, amely soha nem old fel semmit — azon elemek számára, amelyeknek nincs rá szükségük."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Accepts a fully resolved [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md) *or* a raw BCP47 tag string. When a string is\npassed, [makeStrings](makeStrings.md) derives weekday names via `Intl.DateTimeFormat` and all other strings\nfall back to English; pass a bundle for full translations."
msgstr "Accepts a fully resolved [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md) *or* a raw BCP47 tag string. When a string is\npassed, [makeStrings](makeStrings.md) derives weekday names via `Intl.DateTimeFormat` and all other strings\nfall back to English; pass a bundle for full translations."

